// thrV2176_x64 is Dart 2.17.6's Thread field table for x86_64 with compressed
// pointers. Only the _nocompress variant existed before, so a compressed
// x86_64 build of this version got no Thread annotations at all -- and with
// them went dispatch_table_array, which is what the x86 handler keys the
// whole dispatch-table path off. dispatch_hits was 0 on every such sample
// while the same Dart source on arm64 gave 192158.
